  "releaseNotes": "v1.6.1: documentation and packaging patch - every public member now carries XML documentation (CS1591 is enforced as a build error) and the README was reviewed for accuracy; RequeueOnFailure is now documented with its real semantics (bounded retries up to MaxRetryAttempts, then dead-letter or drop). Previous release: v1.6.0 - RabbitMqOptions are validated through IValidateOptions - an empty host or user name, an out-of-range port, a non-positive channel pool size or an unknown DefaultExchangeType fails at startup instead of on the first publish. Full documentation & release notes: https://quoclinh.id.vn/docs/linkit",
